# Options of the XiaoTai event log. Each maps to the macro of the same name
# without the CONFIG_ prefix in include/xiaotai/eventlog_config.h; the
# defaults here and there are the same (test/eventlog_config_test.c checks it).
menu "XiaoTai event log"

    config XIAOTAI_EVENTLOG_SINKS_MAX
        int "Sinks the table holds"
        range 1 16
        default 4
        help
            Receivers of every event (the console's AT+LOG FOLLOW, later a
            persistent store). Registering more is an error at init.

    config XIAOTAI_EVENTLOG_TOPICS_MAX
        int "Topics the table holds"
        range 1 64
        default 16
        help
            Mailboxes of real-time reports, one per report of the selected
            engines. Registering more is an error at init and the producer
            gets no handle. The table lives in external RAM where the board
            has it.

endmenu
